			"Message": "chore(River): update toml dependency to 0.9.1\n\nThis commit updates the `toml` crate version in River's Cargo.toml from 0.9.0 to 0.9.1. River serves as the high-performance asynchronous filesystem reader in Land's architecture, and maintaining up-to-date dependencies ensures compatibility with the broader Rust ecosystem and security patches.\n\nThe change affects the build-time dependencies used for TOML parsing during development tooling operations. This update aligns with Land's commitment to modern, type-safe systems programming practices while maintaining minimal runtime footprint. The version bump follows semver conventions and does not introduce breaking changes to River's public API.",
