			"Message": "chore(license): relicense project under CC0 1.0 Universal\n\n- Replaces Land Public License v1.0 with CC0 1.0 Universal public domain dedication\n- Removes copyleft requirements and simplifies contribution/usage terms\n- Aligns with project goals of maximum permissiveness for community adoption\n- Retains copyright notice but waives all exclusive rights under copyright law\n- Enables unrestricted use/modification/distribution of Land codebase\n- Maintains project attribution while removing license compatibility concerns\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: This fundamentally changes licensing terms from reciprocal copyleft (LPL) to public domain dedication. All previous LPL obligations are removed.",
			"SHA": "3e531f4c41d46f9f488a73522201d623657da9c2"
