			"Message": "docs(contributing): standardize URL casing in documentation links\n\n- Updated all `HTTPS` protocol references to lowercase `https` in CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, and README.md\n- Ensures consistency in documentation link formatting across project files\n- Addresses potential confusion from mixed-case protocol declarations while maintaining functional equivalence\n- Aligns with standard web URL conventions and improves markdown readability\n- Affects community-facing documentation without impacting core Land architecture components",
