				20,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(License): Migrate from CC0 to Land Public License v1.0\n\nReplaced Creative Commons Zero license with custom Land Public License (LPL) v1.0 to better align with project's open-source governance model. The new license:\n- Introduces copyleft provisions requiring LPL-licensed components to remain open\n- Explicitly separates LPL-covered work from External Works to avoid implicit relicensing\n- Adds patent grants with defensive termination clauses\n- Defines compatibility mechanisms with reciprocal licenses like GPLv3+ and MPL 2.0\n- Includes detailed attribution requirements and source code distribution rules\n- Establishes Sofia, Bulgaria as jurisdiction for dispute resolution\n\nThis change reflects Land's transition from permissive licensing to a sustainable open-source model that protects collaborative improvements while maintaining VS Code extension compatibility through the Cocoon shim layer.",
			"SHA": "305187399438f14a57899b90129c0dc20d39597b"
